<title>NIGERIA: Nigerian Cadbury profit rises.</title>
<headline>Nigerian Cadbury profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year result for Nigeria's Cadbury to end-June (In million naira).</p>
<p>			     1996	  1995</p>
<p> Turnover		   3,100  vs   2,000</p>
<p> Profit before taxation 265.6  vs   239.8</p>
<p> Taxation			85  vs    88.7</p>
<p> Profit after taxation  180.6  vs   151.1</p>
<p>($1=80 naira)</p>
<p>-- Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
</text>
